msgstr "توفر AnduinOS دعمًا أصليًا لأجهزة تحكم Xbox عبر البلوتوث."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2060 assets/anduinos-oobe:2346
msgid "The advanced xpadneo driver is already set up and ready for gaming."
msgstr "برنامج التشغيل المتقدم xpadneo مُعد بالفعل وجاهز للألعاب."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2063 assets/anduinos-oobe:2349
msgid ""
"For advanced features like rumble and accurate mapping, we recommend "
